      "en": "Do two walk together, unless they have agreed?",
      "ko": "두 사람이 의합지 못하고야 어찌 동행하겠으며",
      "source_text_hash": "cee8a32ba8cc315f1920ceb820b3d617d517ce2080ae68f3d4688bf4bf14c3d3",
      "translation_text_hash": "e7209dbf998019e6695e382016666293df05169f20b5bf48d6b0946cafa968cc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
