      "en": "Can a bird fall in a trap on the earth, where no snare is set for him? Does a snare spring up from the ground, when there is nothing to catch?",
      "ko": "창애를 땅에 베풀지 아니하고야 새가 어찌 거기 치이겠으며 아무 잡힌 것이 없고야 창애가 어찌 땅에서 뛰겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "2ec5ae652e5789b2721451f7db5889689003cb4645645c30e4ed717d7cfa2238",
      "translation_text_hash": "1b8f77cbb5976df2eefc8088fdff8301ec7fc9d38894aa883560b2b914716b02",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
