      "en": "The lion has roared. Who will not fear? The Lord GOD has spoken. Who can but prophesy?",
      "ko": "사자가 부르짖은즉 누가 두려워하지 아니하겠느냐 주 여호와께서 말씀하신즉 누가 예언하지 아니하겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "e5a0089584f404d93e6afe8aa0704fa6e175e08b7dd638d62a4caa53c90b6bfe",
      "translation_text_hash": "301c7c6e6daddaa3c6f4f25fe05edc80a125488a648ac002731a378a6383cd28",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
